{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "The developer's escape hatch for a type-unknown value: cast it with `as json`.\n`as json` stamps a text of kind json; navigation then materialises through the\njson reader and the field resolves. Companion to NavigationOnTypeUnknown_AsksForAsType:\nthat one leaves the value type-unknown, this one casts it so the field resolves.\nDecision 401 — json is a text of kind json; there is no `object` type.",
